        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "controlled_comparison",
      "statement": "A controlled sandbox comparison kept the same request except for GitHub configuration: the original condition failed its check with relay_requires_raw_token=true, while the corrected condition passed with relay_requires_raw_token=false and completed via the authenticated proxy path, despite the token field remaining redacted in both cases.",
